sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports local cost calculation by CS
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.Enabled[Tariff] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.MaxElements[Tariff] > 0
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has TariffCtrlr.ConditionsSupported[Tariff] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the tariff of the transaction with<br>- validFrom<br>- Price for energy with condition on startTimeOfDay and endTimeOfDay

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeTransactionTariffRequest (transactionId, tariff)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must be <transaction id><br>tariff.validFrom must be <not omitted><br>tariff.energy.prices[0].priceKwh must be <not omitted><br>tariff.energy.prices[0].conditions.startTimeOfDay must be in format as per RFC 3339: time-hour ":" time-minute<br>tariff.energy.prices[0].conditions.endTimeOfDay must be in format as per RFC 3339: time-hour ":" time-minute

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeTransactionTariffResponse (status = ConditionNotSupported)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
